{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade It</strong> is a unique idle game with near-endless possibilities. Maximize your income by upgrading generators, purchasing powerful boosts, and unlocking new gameplay features. Leverage a unique prestige system to permanently empower your generators after a local progress reset. Collect achievements and complete all in-game goals to claim victory!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with 99 income generators. Optimize your profits by upgrading each one individually. Use up to 10 special prestige upgrades per generator by performing a localized reset. Invest in special currency generators and find the optimal strategy to complete every goal and challenge!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Addictive Idle Gameplay:</strong> Easy to start, hard to put down.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Prestige System:</strong> A complex and rewarding loop of progression and reset.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>1,000+ Unique Upgrades:</strong> A vast array of power-ups to discover and purchase.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Full Automation:</strong> Auto-buyers and extra currencies passive generators streamline your progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>In-Game Challenges:</strong> Optional objectives for added motivation and replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Steam Achievements:</strong> Prove your mastery and dedication.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Polished Presentation:</strong> A clean user interface with customizable graphics and satisfying sound effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Complete Experience:</strong> This is a full release, not an Early Access game - dive into a polished and fun experience right now!</p></li></ul>","achie